      "body": "Dear [Instructing solicitor],\n\nThank you for the records in this case. Before I can complete my report, I need the following:\n\n1. The colonoscopy report from September 2024. It is mentioned in the clinic letter of 24 September (page 1,118) but is not in the bundle.\n2. The practice task list from January to August 2024. The copy provided stops in January. It may show whether the February blood result was seen.\n3. Clearer copies of 4 pages that are too faint to read: pages 612, 618, 640 and 1,183.\n\nPages 412 to 415 appear to be another patient's records. I have set them aside and not relied on them; please let me know if you need them back before they are deleted. If anything above can't be obtained, I'll say so in my report and explain how it affects my opinion.\n\nKind regards,\nDr James Morgan",
